      "text": "1  THIS PETITION, COMING ON FOR ADMISSION, THIS DAY, THE  COURT MADE THE FOLLOWING:\n -2-  NC: 2024:KHC:2246  CRL.RP No. 755 of 2019  ORDER 1.",
