      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "This Revision Petition is filed by the State being aggrieved by the order dated 13.03.2019 passed in Crl.R.P.No.101/2018 on the file of III Addl. District and Sessions Judge, D.K., Mangaluru, wherein the order of taking cognizance has been set-aside by the Revisional Court.",
